{
  "_note": "Get Started was rebuilt from a three-step form into the unified adaptive quiz in design/app/Get Started.dc.html: a 4-phase machine (quiz → brief → estimate → account) whose step list is rebuilt from the answers on every render, across six branches. Every literal string in that design lives here — the extracted seeds only ever covered the retired three-step form. Keys: q_<branch>_<step>_{title,sub}, q_<branch>_<step>_opt_<option>_{label,sub}, q_<branch>_<step>_aside_{hint,caption}, q_<branch>_kicker, plus the shell/brief/estimate/account chrome. The estimate's own prose (headline, row labels, footnote, match blurbs, the generated brief) is NOT here: it is templated from the answers by the pricing engine (apps/projects/pricing.py) and arrives with the quote, because the frontend is forbidden from computing any of it. The design-branch add-on rows come from catalog.Addon so their labels and prices stay in one place. step3_sub/step3_micro/step3_cta carry over unchanged; step3_kicker is restated ('LAST STEP', not 'STEP 3'). Superseded and now unrendered: step1_kicker, step1_heading, step1_sub, step1_cta, step2_kicker, step2_sub, step3_heading — the surfaces they labelled no longer exist. `order-render` and `order-drafting` remain as before: those designs are now redirects into this one (?intent=viz / ?intent=drafting).",
